      "body": "Dividend of ₹0.10 is 80% lower than last year. Ex-date: 30th July 2026 Payment date: 5th September 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.2%, which is lower than the industry average of 0.9%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (39% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (7% cash payout ratio). The dividend has decreased over the past 96 years, indicating a lack of growth and stability in payments. The company's earnings per share (EPS) would need to decline by 57% to shift the payout ratio to a potentially unsustainable range, which is more than the 26% EPS decline seen over the last 5 years.",
